# ============================================================
# Pipeline outputs. This repo ships CODE + SMALL METADATA only.
# Unlike the source repo, whose root was code/ with the data one level up, here
# the repo root IS the project root -- so the hives and source data sit inside
# the working tree and every one of them needs an entry.
# NOTE: no trailing comments on a rule line -- keep notes on their own lines.
# ============================================================

# --- Hives and source data: regenerated by the pipeline or fetched, never committed ---
emp_hive/
acc_hive/
sep_hive/
buzz_feed/
data_opm_gov/
# published to R2 by 16_push_to_r2.R
export/
# published to GCS by aggregate/push_to_gcs.R, then read by BigQuery/Superset
aggregate_data/
# EOP indicator coding docs
metadata/eop/eop_coding_source

# --- Large referenced data: fetched from R2/OSF or regenerated ---
# raw BLS dumps -- setup/get_bls_data.R
metadata/bls/raw/
# redaction matrices -- validation/redaction_check.R
metadata/validation/*.parquet
# NA inventory reports -- buildInventory(), regenerated every run
# metadata/na_treatment/checks/ is deliberately NOT ignored: it is the only
# committed record of label-gap results, and its monthly diff is the signal.
metadata/na_treatment/inventory/
# per-variable inspection CSVs -- codebook/01_codebook_inspection.R
metadata/codebook/inspection/
# coverage-gap detail -- rewritten by codebook/02_codebook_build.R every run and
# read by docs/fwoc_codebook.qmd when the codebook is rendered, so run 02 before
# rendering from a fresh clone. The codebook table itself IS tracked: 02 and
# validation/04 both read it back as an input.
metadata/codebook/gap_detail.csv
# validation run reports -- pipeline-generated by validation/*.R
validation_output/

# --- Quarto render outputs (PDF/HTML) + scratch -- the .qmd sources stay tracked ---
docs/*.pdf
docs/*.html
codebook/*.html
README.html
/.quarto/
**/*_files/
**/*_cache/
**/*.quarto_ipynb

# --- Pipeline run logs ---
fwoc_build_log_*.txt
rebuild_log_*.txt

# --- Local working notes and internal ops references ---
# Machine- and process-specific notes for one checkout. The file's own header
# states it is gitignored; until now nothing enforced that.
CLAUDE.local.md
# Superset dashboard query definitions -- an internal ops reference against the
# BigQuery external tables, not an input to or output of this pipeline.
aggregate/superset_*.md
# Working record of the agency and subagency label coding: rulings, sweeps,
# verification runs, logs and the provenance record. Internal; kept on disk only.
# The reviewed inputs the pipeline reads are in metadata/labels/fwoc_ship/.
docs/fwoc_agency_subagency_labels/
# testthat suite for the pure helpers, and the CI workflow that runs it. Kept on
# disk and run locally; publishing them is deferred to V2. Remove these rules
# when the tests are published.
tests/
.github/
